From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 20:23:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Pixel-art night village theme with walking character

- Full-screen canvas scene drawn in code: starry sky, moon, parallax
  mountains, ivy-covered stone cottages, market stalls, windmill, bridge,
  spirit tree, campfire, fireflies, chimney smoke, bats, shooting stars
- Scrolling the page walks a pixel wanderer through the village; the path
  is drawn in front of the content so she is never hidden behind a card
- Game-style UI: pixel fonts, framed panels, dialogue box, inventory slots,
  quest cards, pixel buttons; all existing content and links unchanged
- Respects prefers-reduced-motion; works at phone widths
- Dark pixel Open Graph share image

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
